WEBVTT

00:10:29.318 --> 00:10:31.205
(Laughter)

00:10:31.205 --> 00:10:32.753
This technological revolution

00:10:32.753 --> 00:10:35.281
is as inspiring and transformational

00:10:35.281 --> 00:10:37.294
as anything we have ever seen.

00:10:37.294 --> 00:10:40.684
Human creativity and innovation
have always propelled us forward.

00:10:40.684 --> 00:10:42.131
They've created jobs.

00:10:42.131 --> 00:10:43.520
They've raised living standards.

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:45.323
They've made our lives

00:10:45.323 --> 00:10:47.383
healthier and more rewarding.

00:10:47.383 --> 00:10:48.626
And the new wave of innovation

00:10:48.626 --> 00:10:50.976
which is beginning to sweep through industry

00:10:50.976 --> 00:10:52.598
is no different.

00:10:52.598 --> 00:10:54.614
In the U.S. alone, the industrial Internet

00:10:54.614 --> 00:10:58.554
could raise average income by 25 to 40 percent

00:10:58.554 --> 00:11:00.246
over the next 15 years,